    <string name="text_wallet_info"><![CDATA[
<font color=#F21541>How are points credited into my wallet?</font><font color=#2D415A> You get 10% of your Match
Contests and Tournaments points. For example, if you score 20K
points in a tournament, you get 2K points in your wallet.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>What are wallet tiers?</font><font color=#2D415A> Based on the number of wallet points you
collect you are assigned a tier. There are four tiers: Bronze(achieved
at 0 points), Silver(at 5K points) , Gold (at 10K points) and Platinum (at
20K points). All new members start at Bronze tier.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>How are wallet points calculated?</font><font color=#2D415A> Wallet points are reset to 0 at the
start of each membership year. For example, if you joined fanzania
on 15 MAR then your wallet points are reset to 0 points on 15 MAR of
every year. Membership year window is unique to each user.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>How do I maintain or move up wallet tiers?</font><font color=#2D415A> Your status at the end of
the current membership year is carried forward to the next
membership year. To maintain or move up tiers, you need to collect
the necessary points required for that tier.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>What happens if I don’t collect enough points to maintain my tier?</font><font color=#2D415A> If
you are unable to collect the necessary points in the ongoing
membership year, your status drops by one tier when entering the
subsequent membership year.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>WITHDRAW button will be enabled upon Bank account verification and if you have sufficient money available to withdraw.</font><br><br><font color=#F21541>If you want to know more, please reach us at support@fanzania.com</font>]]></string>
